{"id":"3bdfe6bfd8cbf765","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-promise-problem.md","title":"承诺问题与承诺域上的求解","display":"df-promise-problem — 承诺问题与承诺域上的求解","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-promise-problem","aliases":["28-df-promise-problem"],"display":"df-promise-problem — 承诺问题与承诺域上的求解","depends_on":[],"source_book_location":"§23.4","source_printed_pages":"504","source_pdf_pages":"530","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_proof_reviewed":false,"eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"revision":"R5","verification_status":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-promise-problem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-promise-problem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-promise-problem — 承诺问题与承诺域上的求解"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<span class=\"property-null\">无</span>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"§23.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"504"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"530"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_proof_reviewed","html":"false"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"revision","html":"R5"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-or-example-statement-compared"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\\notin\\Sigma\">\\(\\bot\\notin\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1,\\bot\\}\">\\(f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1,\\bot\\}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(A:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot\">\\(\\bot\\)</span> 表示承诺域外。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Dom}(f)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\Sigma^*:f(x)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\},\\quad Y_f\\coloneqq f^{-1}(\\{1\\}),\\quad N_f\\coloneqq f^{-1}(\\{0\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Dom}(f)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\Sigma^*:f(x)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\},\\quad Y_f\\coloneqq f^{-1}(\\{1\\}),\\quad N_f\\coloneqq f^{-1}(\\{0\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Solves}(A,f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{Dom}(f)\\quad A(x)=f(x).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Solves}(A,f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{Dom}(f)\\quad A(x)=f(x).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"Y_f\\cap N_f=\\varnothing,\\qquad\\operatorname{Dom}(f)=Y_f\\cup N_f.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[Y_f\\cap N_f=\\varnothing,\\qquad\\operatorname{Dom}(f)=Y_f\\cup N_f.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>承诺域外对答案完全不作要求，求解算法本身仍可为全函数。可等价表示为互不相交的 yes/no 两集合，但不能把所有域外输入默认为 no。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§23.4；印刷页 504；PDF 页 530。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot\\notin\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"A:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bot","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Dom}(f)\\coloneqq\\{x\\in\\Sigma^*:f(x)\\in\\{0,1\\}\\},\\quad Y_f\\coloneqq f^{-1}(\\{1\\}),\\quad N_f\\coloneqq f^{-1}(\\{0\\}).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Solves}(A,f)\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{Dom}(f)\\quad A(x)=f(x).","display":true},{"tex":"Y_f\\cap N_f=\\varnothing,\\qquad\\operatorname{Dom}(f)=Y_f\\cup N_f.","display":true}],"bytes":1365,"backlinks":[{"id":"08147f5acef354b7","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f:\\{0,1\\}^*\\to\\{0,1,\\bot\\}$、$\\operatorname{Dom}(f)$ 见 [[28-df-promise-problem]]。$\\mathbf{BoolCirc}_{n,1},\\operatorname{BF},\\operatorname{out}_C$ 见 [[28-df-boolean-circuit]]，非输入门数 $\\operatorname{size}$ 见 [[28-df-circuit-size]]。$s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb R_{\\ge0}$。"},{"id":"a3e8c2b19a60e5f8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$，$f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\{0,1,\\bot\\}$；$Y_f,N_f$ 见 [[28-df-promise-problem]]。$\\mathrm{TM}$、$M(u)$、$\\operatorname{time}_M(u)$ 见 [[28-df-tm]]、[[28-df-machine-resources]]；$\\operatorname{pair}_{01}$ 见 [[28-df-binary-pair-encoding]]。$U_j$ 为 $\\Sigma^j$ 上均匀分布，随机带在证明固定后独立抽样。单比特串与相应的 $0,1$ 认同。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-414","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[28-df-formal-complexity-measure]]、[[28-thm-formal-measure-formula-bound]]、[[28-lem-formal-measure-quarter-large]]、[[28-thm-formal-measure-almost-everywhere]]、[[28-df-promise-problem]]、[[28-df-promise-ma]]、[[28-df-promise-circuit-size]]、[[28-thm-promise-ma-fixed-polynomial-lower-bound]]、[[28-prop-xor-lower-bound-largeness]]、[[28-ex-singleton-property-not-large]]。"}],"outgoing":[]}